        "template": "mpls static-lsp [parameter1] ingress destination [parameter2] next-hop [parameter3] out-label [parameter4]",
        "command": "mpls static-lsp AtoC ingress destination 192.168.3.9/32 next-hop 10.1.1.2 out-label 20",
        "explanation": "配置从入口到目的地的静态 LSP，名称为 'AtoC'，目的地为 192.168.3.9/32，下一跳为 10.1.1.2，出标签为 20",
